        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sir Ebenezer Howard\n- Concepts: garden city movement, urban planning\n\nFacts:\n- In 1898, Sir Ebenezer Howard initiated the garden city movement.\n- The garden city movement is a method of urban planning based on self-contained communities surrounded by greenbelts.\n- The garden city movement includes proportionate areas of residences, industry, and agriculture.\n- Sir Ebenezer Howard was born on 29 January 1850 and died on 1 May 1928.\n- Sir Ebenezer Howard was an English founder of the garden city movement.\n- The chunk states that Sir Ebenezer Howard is known for an erotica publication in 1898.",
